# Supabase connection for the web app.
#
# Both of these are SAFE to commit / expose publicly: the anon key can only
# read or write rows that Row Level Security allows, and RLS here restricts
# everything to the logged-in owner. See README "Security".
#
# These are read at BUILD time. If you'd rather not rebuild, you can leave them
# blank and the app will show a one-time setup screen that stores the same two
# values in your browser's localStorage instead.
#
# NEVER put the Supabase service_role key here. That key lives only inside the
# iOS shortcut on your device.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
